<title>USA: Converse stake held by Vinik group.</title>
<headline>Converse stake held by Vinik group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Boston investor Jeffery Vinik said Monday it holds an 8.9 percent stake in Converse Inc, or 1,498,500 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought the stake between Dec 3, 1996, and Jan 24 at $10.81 to $17.875 per share.</p>
<p>Converse, based on Boston, Mass., makes athletic footwear and apparel.</p>
</text>
